{
  "name": "44 · Price Tracker (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 44 · Price Tracker\nTrack the price of anything online: your supplier's raw material, a competitor's product, a machine you want to buy. Every morning it reads the price, logs it, and WhatsApps you when it **drops** or goes below your target. No AI needed.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Track**: Product, URL, CSS selector, Last price, Lowest, Alert below. Tab **Price log**: Date, Product, Price.\n2. CSS selector: right-click the price on the page → Inspect → copy its class, e.g. `.price` or `.a-price-whole`.\n3. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n\nSome big sites block automated visits; then the log says 'not found'. Follow each site's terms.",
        "height": 637,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "32590e62-52b5-4e57-bc4e-836a37ed8f20",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 7,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a13137f3-1e70-477f-a0ba-f60ccd40912a",
      "name": "Daily 7 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Track"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c7dd1fb8-3ab6-413f-b8c3-a35313cc75c0",
      "name": "Track list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.URL }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "2724dd34-dae3-43cc-9f51-70f810631546",
      "name": "Open product page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "extractHtmlContent",
        "dataPropertyName": "data",
        "extractionValues": {
          "values": [
            {
              "key": "price",
              "cssSelector": "={{ $('Track list').item.json['CSS selector'] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "trimValues": true
        }
      },
      "id": "866939d8-f45b-45c5-8bdd-4b63536aa2da",
      "name": "Read the price",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.html",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Track tab: Product, URL, CSS selector (where the price is, e.g. .a-price-whole), Last price, Lowest, Alert below (optional ₹)\nconst t = $('Track list').item.json;\nconst raw = Array.isArray($json.price) ? $json.price[0] : $json.price;\nconst price = Number(String(raw || '').replace(/[^0-9.]/g, '')) || null;\nconst last = Number(t['Last price']) || null, low = Number(t.Lowest) || price, below = Number(t['Alert below']) || 0;\nreturn { json: { Product: t.Product, URL: t.URL, price, last, found: !!price, dropped: !!price && !!last && price < last,\n  hit_target: !!price && below > 0 && price <= below, lowest: price ? Math.min(price, low || price) : low } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "3651d77e-dae6-4af3-a472-1aaf6d96463b",
      "name": "Parse ₹ + compare",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return { json: { Date: $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd'), Product: $json.Product, Price: $json.price ?? 'not found' } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "880fea9c-d39b-4d1e-b54f-50c52b887bd5",
      "name": "Log row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Price log"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "70c386ce-cefe-4894-9015-c6ca45f2f92a",
      "name": "Price log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const p = $('Parse ₹ + compare').item.json;\nreturn { json: p.found ? { Product: p.Product, 'Last price': p.price, Lowest: p.lowest } : { Product: p.Product } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "b2a35956-12bc-4eaf-a27a-2818a037be8d",
      "name": "Track update",
